# corpus/ IS tracked — the committed cases are the CI regression set (replayed
# by tests/corpus_replay.rs). It does NOT collect campaign noise: `fuzz.sh run`
# writes the live corpus OFF-TREE ($EEZ_FUZZ_SCRATCH); `fuzz.sh promote` folds
# new finds in (minimized) so you `git add` + commit to EXTEND it deliberately.
# The root workspace Cargo.lock is authoritative (this is a workspace member).
